# Proxy Firebase Auth handler routes to Firebase Hosting so OAuth redirects
# (Apple, Google popup/redirect, signInWithRedirect getRedirectResult round
# trip) actually land on Firebase's handler script. Without these the SPA's
# index.html is served for /__/auth/handler, the OAuth callback never runs,
# and the user is stuck on a blank page after sign-in.
/__/auth/* https://armin-web.firebaseapp.com/__/auth/:splat 200
/__/firebase/* https://armin-web.firebaseapp.com/__/firebase/:splat 200

# SPA fallback for everything else.
/* /index.html 200
